.ly_state/session\audit_reports\role21_backtest_recommendations_audit_20260529.md:37:**Why**: GP frequently converges to constant signals (all positive or all negative). When `np.sign(constant)` is applied, all positions = +1 or -1 → equal weight strategy → Sharpe just reflects the long/short bias of the test year.
