.ly_state/session\audit_reports\role21_backtest_round3_audit_20260529.md:31:**Issue**: `fwd_ret_5 = close.pct_change(5).shift(-5)` produces 5-day overlapping returns. Each daily observation contains the same 5-day window data 5 times → autocorrelation → Sharpe inflated by sqrt(5) = 2.24x.
.ly_state/session\audit_reports\role21_backtest_round3_audit_20260529.md:33:**Evidence**: EqualWeight (constant +1 long) gives Sharpe 7.37 in 2017. Real annual Sharpe of long-only VN30 in 2017 should be ~3.0 max → confirms ~2.5x inflation.
.ly_state/session\audit_reports\role21_backtest_round3_audit_20260529.md:35:**Fix**: Use non-overlapping 1-day returns for Sharpe calculation, OR adjust by Newey-West correction:
.ly_state/session\audit_reports\role21_backtest_round3_audit_20260529.md:62:| Strategy | Reported Sharpe (avg) | Realistic Sharpe (after sqrt(5) + sqrt(30) correction) |
